      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ESomersetshire Syllabub.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n1136. In a large china bowl put a pint of port, and a pint of sherry or other white wine; sugar to taste. Milk the bowl full. In twenty minutes\u0027 time cover it pretty high with \u003Ca href=\u0022clouted-cream.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eclouted cream\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E; grate over it nutmeg, and put in pounded cinnamon and \u003Ca href=\u0022comfits.html\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Enonpareil comfits\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E.\u003Cbr\u003E"
